[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10683.269, "timestamp": "02:58:03", "text": "ええと、あなたの、ええ、あなたの、普通"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10684.87, "timestamp": "02:58:04", "text": "呪文スロットはレベル1です。あなたの黒人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10686.79, "timestamp": "02:58:06", "text": "ただし、魔法の呪文スロットはレベル2です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10688.87, "timestamp": "02:58:08", "text": "うわあ、それはひどい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10691.75, "timestamp": "02:58:11", "text": "ああ、このクソ野郎どもが本当に嫌いだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10692.95, "timestamp": "02:58:12", "text": "生き物たちよ、今や。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10694.87, "timestamp": "02:58:14", "text": "私は当然知っている？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10700.15, "timestamp": "02:58:20", "text": "おお。全く役に立たない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10703.66, "timestamp": "02:58:23", "text": "えっと、私にできるかどうか試してみます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10706.469, "timestamp": "02:58:26", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10708.55, "timestamp": "02:58:28", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10715.349, "timestamp": "02:58:35", "text": "さあ行こう。私の心の腕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10717.67, "timestamp": "02:58:37", "text": "わかった。見てみましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10718.71, "timestamp": "02:58:38", "text": "彼はキャンセルするつもりだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10721.67, "timestamp": "02:58:41", "text": "ええ、これはあなたから始まったものです。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10723.67, "timestamp": "02:58:43", "text": "馴染みのあるIから派生する可能性があると思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10723.99, "timestamp": "02:58:43", "text": "考える。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10725.91, "timestamp": "02:58:45", "text": "はい、可能です。そうかもしれない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10728.07, "timestamp": "02:58:48", "text": "そう、私は文字通りただ動くことができる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10728.95, "timestamp": "02:58:48", "text": "ここにプリズムがあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10730.23, "timestamp": "02:58:50", "text": "よし。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10732.309, "timestamp": "02:58:52", "text": "彼は飛んでいる。彼は飛行速度が速い。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10734.79, "timestamp": "02:58:54", "text": "これは本当に私が作るものです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10738.15, "timestamp": "02:58:58", "text": "全員、筋力セーブをする"}]